    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"quiet relief\"? i dont know. it just feels like the shame is the worst part. everyone thinks i'm this successful guy and now i'm just going to be the guy who lost it all. i feel like i'm just waiting for the impact. what does \"quiet relief\" even mean in a situation like this?",
